# First run: the one computer command is named, and Check again says
# plainly that nothing has arrived yet rather than doing nothing.
expect Connect Miniflux
expect kobo connect
expect-missing secret set
clean
shot rss-miniflux-connect
tap Check again
wait-for No account has arrived
clean
shot rss-miniflux-check-again
tap Suggested feeds
expect Suggested feeds
clean
shot rss-miniflux-directory
# Choosing a feed before there is an account goes to the address, the one
# setting the reader can take without the computer.
tap NASA Science
wait-for Server address
expect kobo connect rss-miniflux
expect Suggested feeds
clean
shot rss-miniflux-settings-unconfigured
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-for Connect Miniflux
